SUMMARY:Holiday Wreath Making with Fresh Evergreens
DESCRIPTION:Get your home holiday-ready at Gather Sebastopol with a hands-on fresh wreath workshop. You’ll work with cedar\, redwood\, fir\, and pine to build a full\, festive 14-inch wreath\, and you’ll leave with it ready to hang for the season. \nYou’ll: \n• Learn how different evergreens work together in a wreath\n• Choose and combine greens for a full\, balanced look\n• Practice basic wreath-making techniques as you build your wreath\n• Add natural decorations like pinecones and berries\n• Take home your finished fresh evergreen wreath \nNo wreath-making experience needed. All materials included.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/holiday-wreath-making-with-fresh-evergreens/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/holiday-wreath.png
END:VEVENT
